-- OPENBRAIN-55: Loewi v5, readable headings, captions and timeline in the book.
-- Only the marked Open Brain book block changes; Maura's v4 export is untouched.
-- Payload equals src/widgets/uploads/loewi-vagusstoff.html (historyLoewiV5.sql.test.js).
-- Apply only over the exact v4 upload; preserve metadata and unrelated rows.
-- An edited/missing upload aborts for review, and replay is a no-op.
-- Rollback: re-upload the v4 payload from 20261118090000 in Dashboard > Widgets.
DO $v5$
DECLARE
  prior_html text;
  next_html text := $w$<!doctype html>
<!--
  Open Brain widget
  Title:    Loewi's Vagusstoff, 1921
  Chapter:  History (Foundations of Neuroscience), "How do neurons communicate?"
  Author:   Stuart Trenholm (experiment, narration, timeline) · Artwork and narration: Maura
  Version:  4 (2026-11-17), in the book 2026-11-18
  Changes:  Maura's 17 Nov file: the whole narration recorded again in her new AI voice
            (Stuart asked for a full redo), the captions' timing paired to it, a cleaned-up
            timeline and player (speed, round icon buttons) and a better Vagusstoff animation.
            The file is hers as exported ("Loewi_Vagusstoff_Nov17/index.html"), byte for byte,
            except this comment and the one block marked "Open Brain book" before the
            figure, which adds what the book needs and changes nothing else when the file
            is opened on its own:
              - the book's plate and mono font through the --ob-* tokens, her values as fallbacks;
              - in the figure pane (html[data-ob-fit]) the figure takes the height it is given;
              - inline in the book on a phone it is as tall as its content, not the viewport;
              - no spinner rotation under reduced motion (the animation itself only
                plays when the reader presses Play);
              - no time-and-section tooltip over the timeline ("0:50 · Collecting"), which
                Maura asked us to remove on 18 Nov.
-->
<html><head><meta charset=utf8><meta name=viewport content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><style>:root{color-scheme:light;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}body{margin:0;padding:0;font:14px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#000}img{max-width:100%}[hidden]:not([hidden=until-found i]){display:none!important}</style></head><body>
